---
import { doiUrl } from '../lib/site';
---

<figure class="ahn-example">
  <div class="ahn-example-body">
    <p class="overline">Illustrated example</p>
    <h2>From ultrasound views to one severity grade</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <div class="ahn-example-views" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <div><strong>Locate the kidney</strong><p>Find the kidney region in each view.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="ahn-example-views ahn-example-masks" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <div><strong>Segment and grade each view</strong><p>KUSNet outlines the kidney. PHCNet grades the segmented views. In this example all three give grade II.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="ahn-example-grade" aria-hidden="true">II</div>
        <div><strong>Combine the grades</strong><p>Weighted voting gives one subject-level result: Society for Fetal Urology grade II.</p></div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Original schematic based on the study’s methods. The views and example grades are illustrative. <a href={doiUrl('10.1016/j.eswa.2024.124594')}>Study methods</a></figcaption>
</figure>
